  74:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the RCC extended peripherals clocks according to the specified
  75:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****   *         parameters in the RCC_PeriphCLKInitTypeDef.
